    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lusimo lwe chifuruusi ne kumusabibu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi amboolela ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwana wo mundu, boolela Baisiraeli lusimo luno, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bolaane khumanya niko ese Omwami WELE mboola. Yabao efuruusi emboofu ne kamafumbo kamabalaayi ne chindaa chimboofu chichachalaala. Yapurukha yacha khu ngulu cha Lebanoni yakwa yabuta khasaafu khemusia khu mutarakwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nikho yayila mu sibala sie khukusia ne khukulaana mala yakhara mu lukoba luboofu lwe bakusia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio yabukula lumiicho lwe mu sibala sia Isiraeli mala yalumiicha mu maloba ke ngakha a sireende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khasaala khamela khachoa khaba kumusabibu kukwalaamila asi, ne chisakia chachoa chaniina chalola niio efuruusi eli, ne kimili kiakwo kiekha asi. Nio kwekela kumusabibu, kwarakho chisakia ne kamasaafu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nekhali yabao efuruusi ekiindi emboofu eye kamaani ne chindaa chimbalaayi ne kamafumbo kamakali. Ne lola, kumusabibu kuno kwayila kimili kiakwo niio efuruusi yino eli, ne kwarusia chisakia chakwo chalola niio eli, ne lilieyikina bali khulanyoola kameechi kamakali khukhila niio kwamela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali kumusabibu beele kwabiaalwa khale mu ngakha niio kameechi kali kamakali niio kunyala kwaba ne chisakia kwame kamatuunda mala kube kumulayi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami WELE areeba ali, “Kumusabibu kuno kulachoa ku? Efuruusi endaayi se lakukhuula ne khufuna chisakia mala kamatuunda kakwo koome ta ku? Se larumikhira kamaani kamakali namwe ekholo emboofu khukukhuula tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwabiaalwa, ne kakhali kulakhula ku? Se kuloma siimiyu ne siicha tawe ku? Se ali abwene ne abwene niio kulomela tawe ku?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lusimo lwinoosibwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi amboolela ese Esekieli ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.24.15+2KI.24.16+2KI.24.17+2KI.24.18+2KI.24.19+2KI.24.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bab. 24.15-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.10+2CH.36.11+2CH.36.12+2CH.36.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ke Ch. 36.10-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Reeba Baisiraeli barengu bano kaaba bali bamanyile niko lusimo luno luboola. Baboolele oli, ‘Lola omwami owa Babiloni echa Yerusalemu mala abukula omwami walwo ne babemeelesi balwo, mala abakobosia e Babiloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne abukulamo mulala owe lisaaye lie bubwami mala bafukiilisiana ne naye, ne amwechubia khuba omusuubilwa. Abukula babemeelesi nga baboe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nio sibala silekhe khuba ne kamaani lundi tawe ne khubona mbo lifukiilisiana liekholekhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali Omwami owa Yuda aba omureengu khu niye, aruma wamwanda e Misiri asaba chifarasi ne banamae bakali. Alanyala ku? Omundu oyo anyala aona ku? Se anyala aloba khukhola niko bafukiilisiana mala aloba khuba ne siuukuumo tawe!’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omwami WELE echubile ali, “Nga ese nendi Wele omenyile mindali, omwami yuno alafwila mu Babiloni sikila afunaka embuliilisiani ne liliechuba nilio akhola no mwami owa Babiloni owamura khu bwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akhaba banamae bo mwami owa Misiri se balamuyeeta mwiie tawe, nga Babiloni babuusia liloba ne khulima buko khulwe khukhwira babaandu bakali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikila alekelesia liliechuba liewe ne mbuliilisiani yewe, sikila afukiilila mala khukhola nga nilwo kenyibwa tawe, se alebacha tawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako Omwami WELE echuba ali, “Nga ese Wele omenyile mindali, nja khumuukuuma khulwe khulekha khukhola niko elakana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndareka lurimba lwase mala akwemo. Ndamuyila e Babiloni mala emuukuumileyo sikila sabeele omusuubilwa khwise tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne banamae bewe boosi barana balafwila mwiie ne bakhaone bakhasalanisibwe chimbeka choosi nio enywe mulamanya muli Ese Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi nalomile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.17.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lisuubisia lia Wele lie lilieyikina",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
